fix:
pub fn text(&self, key: &str) -> Option<&str> {
    self.resolve(key).map(|message| message.value)
}
// LocalizedMessage::value is already `&'a str` borrowing `self`, so the owned String is a needless allocation per lookup. Callers needing an owned value add `.map(str::to_owned)`.

